#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:560
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_OhWowItsPlayer"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow!\n"
"It's {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:564
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HeardAboutYouImYourFan"
msgid ""
"I've heard the news!\n"
"You're really strong, aren't you?\p"
"We always argue about who is the\n"
"strongest of all TRAINERS here.\p"
"So when I heard about you, I decided\n"
"to be your fan!\p"
"I hope you'll keep on battling other\n"
"tough TRAINERS.\p"
"That way, we'll be able to see more\n"
"of your hot, hot battles.\p"
"That will make the others here see\n"
"exactly how great you are.\p"
"Remember, I'm cheering for you,\n"
"{PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:580
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YoureOneWeWantToWin"
msgid ""
"Yo, {PLAYER}!\n"
"You're the one we want to win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:584
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_OthersDontKnowYoureTheBest"
msgid ""
"The others, they don't know that\n"
"you're the best of the best!\p"
"Isn't that right, {PLAYER}?\n"
"Show them you've got guts!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:590
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_TrainersPowerIsOutOfTheOrdinary"
msgid ""
"I hate to say this, but the TRAINER\n"
"everybody's talking about is\l"
"{STR_VAR_1}, no question about it!\p"
"That TRAINER's power…\n"
"It's out of the ordinary.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:597
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_TrainerIsBestNoOneWantsToListen"
msgid ""
"Darn it… I've been telling people\n"
"that {STR_VAR_1} is the best now…\p"
"But no one wants to listen…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:602
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HearingAboutToughNewTrainer"
msgid ""
"I've been hearing things about\n"
"a tough new TRAINER.\p"
"This TRAINER's supposed to be beating\n"
"GYM LEADERS, even.\p"
"Do you know anything about this\n"
"new TRAINER?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:610
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ImPullingForYou"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"{PLAYER}!\p"
"Go for it!\n"
"I'm pulling for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:616
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_BrawlyNoImYourFan"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\n"
"BRAWLY…\p"
"Oh, no! Wait!\n"
"That's not right! No, no, no!\p"
"I'm your fan through and through!\p"
"So make me proud!\n"
"Go for it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:625
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ICantHelpLikingBrawly"
msgid ""
"I can't help it, I can only get to\n"
"like BRAWLY…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:629
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_NobodyUnderstandsBrawly"
msgid ""
"Nobody understands the charm of\n"
"BRAWLY…\p"
"I don't care!\p"
"Even if I'm the only one, I'm going\n"
"to keep cheering for BRAWLY!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:636
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_MyFavoriteTrainerIsBrawly"
msgid ""
"Whatever anyone says, my favorite\n"
"TRAINER is DEWFORD's GYM LEADER\l"
"BRAWLY!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:641
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YouveSurpassedYourFather"
msgid ""
"You've surpassed your own father in\n"
"every regard!\p"
"I'm telling you, so there's no question\n"
"about it at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:647
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YourFatherNeverGaveUpSoKeepOnBattling"
msgid ""
"Even when things turned bleak,\n"
"your father never gave up.\p"
"This I know to be true.\p"
"You never give up even if you lose!\n"
"So keep on battling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:654
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_LongWayToGoComparedToNorman"
msgid ""
"NORMAN battled with more power,\n"
"charisma, and showmanship than you.\p"
"Even though people may say that\n"
"you're strong…\p"
"You've still got a long way to go\n"
"compared to your father.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:662
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YouAndNormanAreDifferent"
msgid ""
"You're beginning to get the same\n"
"air of awe NORMAN exudes.\p"
"But there's something conclusively\n"
"different between you and NORMAN.\p"
"I can't tell you what that is.\n"
"You'll have to find it yourself.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:670
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WeDiscussStrongestTrainers"
msgid ""
"Everyone here, we're all huge fans\n"
"of POKéMON battles.\p"
"We discuss who we consider to be\n"
"the strongest of all TRAINERS.\p"
"If you were to become famous,\n"
"we might even become your fans!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:678
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_OhWoweeItsPlayer"
msgid ""
"Oh, woweee! It's {PLAYER}!\n"
"For real, too!\p"
"Please, shake my hand, shake my hand!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:683
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_AlwaysCheerForYou"
msgid ""
"I'll always cheer for you, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Always, always!\p"
"I don't want to see you lose ever,\n"
"{PLAYER}.\p"
"Because I know you're really,\n"
"really strong, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:691
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_EveryoneThinksTrainerIsCool"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} is really cool…\p"
"Everyone thinks so, right, right?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:695
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_TrainerIsReallyCoolItsJustMe"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} really is cool, don't\n"
"you think so?\p"
"Even if it's just me, I'm going to keep\n"
"cheering my favorite TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:701
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WishThereWasTrainerLikeThat"
msgid ""
"My favorite TRAINER is…\p"
"Cool…\p"
"Strong…\p"
"And really nice…\p"
"I wish there was a TRAINER like that…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:708
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WantToBeStrongLikeYou"
msgid ""
"Whoa! It's {PLAYER}!\n"
"Wicked!\p"
"When I grow up, I want to be strong\n"
"like you, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:714
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_OnlyOneWhoCheersForYou"
msgid ""
"Even if I'm the only one…\p"
"You'll always be the only one\n"
"I cheer for, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Because I believe in you, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:720
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_TrainerIsWickedlyCool"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} is so wickedly cool…\n"
"I want to shake hands with my hero.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:724
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_NeverGoingToStopBeingTrainersFan"
msgid ""
"Even if I'm the only one…\p"
"I'm never going to stop being\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s fan!\p"
"Because I've heard, {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"never loses!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:731
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YoureAmazingAfterAll"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}!\n"
"You are amazing after all!\p"
"Ever since I set eyes on you,\n"
"I knew that you were great.\p"
"It looks like my eyes didn't deceive me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:738
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ImInYourCorner"
msgid ""
"Who cares about the others.\n"
"I'm in your corner!\p"
"You don't need to worry. Just get\n"
"out there and battle like always.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:744
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ThinkTrainerIsNumberOne"
msgid ""
"You're a pretty decent TRAINER,\n"
"I think.\p"
"But I also think that {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"is number one right now.\p"
"That's just my opinion.\n"
"Don't worry about it too much.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:752
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YoureMaybeStrongerThanTrainer"
msgid ""
"Wow, you really are strong.\n"
"Maybe even stronger than {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"But {STR_VAR_1} needs me.\p"
"If I don't cheer for {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"who will?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:759
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YouChangedMyMind"
msgid ""
"You've changed my mind!\n"
"You are strong, aren't you?\p"
"I'd like you to tell me how you managed\n"
"to get so strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:765
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YouBattleAttractivelyInToughSituation"
msgid ""
"The tougher the situation, the more\n"
"attractively you battle.\p"
"I can't wait for your next battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:770
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_TrainerIsStandout"
msgid ""
"Among the recently hot TRAINERS,\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} is the standout.\p"
"That toughness, it's simply not normal.\p"
"You're doing okay, but you're not in\n"
"the same class as {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:777
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_NoOneCanKnockYouButTrainerStronger"
msgid ""
"You are really popular…\p"
"You're strong, and you're caring to\n"
"POKéMON. No one can knock you.\p"
"But, you know, I believe in {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} is definitely stronger!\n"
"I'm positive!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:785
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YouImpressive"
msgid ""
"You…\p"
"Impressive!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:789
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_OnlyIRecognizeYourTrueWorth"
msgid ""
"Your true worth, it is fine if only\n"
"I recognized it.\p"
"The others I doubt will understand\n"
"the hidden power that beats within.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:795
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HaventRealizedPotential"
msgid ""
"Yes, I see strength in your eyes.\p"
"But!\p"
"You still haven't realized your\n"
"potential.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc:801
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YourePowerfulButNotTrueStrength"
msgid ""
"It is true that you are tremendously\n"
"powerful.\p"
"But!\n"
"I can tell…\p"
"That strength cannot be considered\n"
"true strength yet!\p"
"True strength is…!\n"
"… …\p"
"Actually, I have no idea, either.$"
msgstr ""
